{
  "id": "E037",
  "title": "Columbus Didn't Have a Wife",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2016-08-06",
  "synopsis": "A couple’s discussion about Christopher Columbus takes an unexpected turn.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/197/7ff5f71d5e4230c758cac1d15bdde0969d214338.mp3",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "哥伦布没有老婆\n\n    一天，一对夫妻聊到了哥伦布。\n    老公：依我看，哥伦布绝对没有老婆。不然，他什么也发现不了。\n    老婆：你为什么这么想？\n    老公：他如果有老婆的话，在出海前，他的老婆一定会问“你去哪儿？为什么去？和谁一起去？什么时候回来？”\n    老婆：那是当然的。哥伦布应该把这些说清楚啊。",
    "traditional": "哥倫布沒有老婆\n\n    一天，一對夫妻聊到了哥倫布。\n    老公：依我看，哥倫布絕對沒有老婆。不然，他什麼也發現不了。\n    老婆：你為什麼這麼想？\n    老公：他如果有老婆的話，在出海前，他的老婆一定會問“你去哪兒？為什麼去？和誰一起去？什麼時候回來？”\n    老婆：那是當然的。哥倫布應該把這些說清楚啊。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Columbus didn’t have any wife"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "一天，一对夫妻聊到了哥伦布。",
      "traditional": "一天，一對夫妻聊到了哥倫布。",
      "pinyin": "yì tiān yí duì fū qī liáo dào le gē lún bù",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "One day, a couple was talking about Columbus."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "老公：依我看，哥伦布绝对没有老婆。",
      "traditional": "老公：依我看，哥倫布絕對沒有老婆。",
      "pinyin": "lǎo gōng yī wǒ kàn gē lún bù jué duì méi yǒu lǎo po",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "不然，他什么也发现不了。",
      "traditional": "不然，他什麼也發現不了。",
      "pinyin": "bù rán tā shén me yě fā xiàn bù liǎo",
      "english": "The Husband: In my opinion, Columbus definitely didn’t have any wife."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Otherwise, he wouldn’t have been able to find anything."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "老婆：你为什么这么想？",
      "traditional": "老婆：你為什麼這麼想？",
      "pinyin": "lǎo po nǐ wèi shén me zhè me xiǎng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "The Wife: Why do you think so?"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "老公：他如果有老婆的话，在出海前，他的老婆一定会问",
      "traditional": "老公：他如果有老婆的話，在出海前，他的老婆一定會問",
      "pinyin": "lǎo gōng tā rú guǒ yǒu lǎo po de huà zài chū hǎi qián tā de lǎo po yí dìng huì wèn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "“你去哪儿？为什么去？和谁一起去？什么时候回来？”",
      "traditional": "“你去哪兒？為什麼去？和誰一起去？什麼時候回來？”",
      "pinyin": "nǐ qù nǎ'r wèi shén me qù hé shéi yì qǐ qù shén me shí hou huí lai",
      "english": "The Husband: If he had a wife, before putting out to sea, his wife would have asked:"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "“Where are you going?  Why are you going? Who are you going together with? When will you come back?”"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "老婆：那是当然的。哥伦布应该把这些说清楚啊。",
      "traditional": "老婆：那是當然的。哥倫布應該把這些說清楚啊。",
      "pinyin": "lǎo po nà shì dāng rán de gē lún bù yīng gāi bǎ zhè xiē shuō qīng chu a",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "The Wife: Of course Columbus should have answered this."
    }
  ],
